      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 800,
        "height": 880,
        "content": "## Scrape Unblocker Template 3\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow runs every four hours to collect Zillow listings based on search input stored in Google Sheets. It builds the search URL, scrapes the Zillow page through Scrape Unblocker, extracts and deduplicates listings, then processes each unique listing with a Gemini-powered AI Agent. The enriched or analyzed output is appended back into a Google Sheet.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure the Google Sheets credentials used by both the source read node and the append-results node.\n- Set the source spreadsheet and range so the workflow can fetch the records or parameters needed to build the Zillow search URL.\n- Configure the Set Search URL node with the correct Zillow search URL field or expression.\n- Add valid Scrape Unblocker credentials or API configuration for the Zillow scraping node.\n- Configure Google Gemini credentials for the chat model used by the AI Agent.\n- Verify the destination Google Sheet columns match the fields produced by the AI Agent before activating the schedule.\n\n### Customization\n\nAdjust the four-hour schedule, Zillow search URL, listing extraction code, deduplication logic, AI Agent prompt/model, and output sheet columns to match the target market and desired listing analysis."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
